WEBVTT

00:00.960 --> 00:03.440
Huh? What even is this?

00:03.440 --> 00:06.400
This is totally new for me.

00:09.720 --> 00:11.440
What don't you understand?

00:11.440 --> 00:15.910
<b>Translate the English sentence to Japanese.</b>

00:12.820 --> 00:15.450
Do you at least know what this part means?

00:16.710 --> 00:18.200
Um...

00:19.040 --> 00:21.370
<b>Tell</b>

00:19.040 --> 00:21.370
<b>Rie</b>

00:19.140 --> 00:20.810
To tell Rie something?

00:21.370 --> 00:23.180
Oh boy.

00:21.370 --> 00:24.960
<b>Tell</b>

00:21.370 --> 00:24.960
<b>Rie</b>

00:23.180 --> 00:25.290
<i>This is more severe than I thought.</i>

00:25.890 --> 00:28.030
It's "tell a lie," as in being dishonest.

00:28.030 --> 00:30.090
What about "the last man"?

00:30.720 --> 00:32.550
As in the final man?

00:32.550 --> 00:34.990
Yeah, so a direct translation would be,

00:34.990 --> 00:37.880
"He is the last man to tell a lie."

00:37.880 --> 00:39.390
What does that mean?

00:39.390 --> 00:43.850
Even if every person on earth was a liar,

00:43.850 --> 00:46.850
he would be the very last person to tell a lie.

00:46.850 --> 00:49.040
Oh, I understand.

00:49.040 --> 00:52.690
Basically, it means he's an honest person.

00:52.690 --> 00:56.410
Oh. So it's you, Ryuto!

00:56.410 --> 00:57.240
Huh?

00:57.620 --> 01:01.050
Even if all boys on Earth 
cheated on their girlfriends,

01:01.050 --> 01:03.770
I don't think you would 
until the very end, Ryuto.

01:03.770 --> 01:06.330
At least that's what I believe.

01:08.170 --> 01:09.980
Shirakawa-san...

01:12.420 --> 01:14.570
Um, okay. Let's do the next one.

01:30.440 --> 01:37.070
<b>Our Dating Story: 
The Experienced You and The Inexperienced Me</b>

02:49.020 --> 02:56.440
<b>Our Dating Story:</b>

02:49.540 --> 02:56.440
<b>The Inexperienced Me Spends the Night</b>

02:50.040 --> 02:56.440
<b>with the Experienced You .</b>

02:52.320 --> 02:53.230
Hey, hey.

02:53.640 --> 02:56.800
Do you remember what this Saturday is?

02:56.800 --> 02:57.580
Huh?

03:00.880 --> 03:02.620
One month!

03:02.620 --> 03:06.330
It's the one-month anniversary of us dating!

03:07.640 --> 03:08.580
Ah!

03:08.580 --> 03:11.290
Wanna go to the beach 
for our one-month anniversary?

03:11.290 --> 03:12.840
Huh? Beach?

03:20.910 --> 03:23.280
What's wrong, Ryuto? You spaced out.

03:23.280 --> 03:25.840
It's... It's nothing!

03:25.840 --> 03:27.770
Yeah, let's go.

03:28.230 --> 03:31.980
Yes! I'm so hyped!

03:31.980 --> 03:33.980
<b>First Term     Final Exam</b>

03:32.440 --> 03:33.980
Ta-da!

03:33.980 --> 03:35.300
Ooh?

03:35.940 --> 03:37.390
Crazy, right?

03:37.390 --> 03:40.040
And it's all because of you. Thanks!

03:40.040 --> 03:42.430
Um, I didn't do that much.

03:42.430 --> 03:45.600
Now I'll be able to fully enjoy the beach!

03:45.600 --> 03:48.720
Hey, what score did you get? Let me see.

03:48.720 --> 03:50.160
Uh, okay.

03:50.440 --> 03:53.210
Ohmygosh! Ryuto dear, you're a god!

03:53.210 --> 03:55.680
Nah, it isn't a big deal.

03:55.680 --> 03:57.880
A god among gods!

04:01.000 --> 04:02.260
Take that.

04:03.200 --> 04:05.440
Mine went up too!

04:05.440 --> 04:07.280
You too, Nisshi?

04:07.280 --> 04:10.430
Now we can enjoy summer without reservation!

04:10.430 --> 04:13.600
This summer, we're livin' the life, man!

04:19.760 --> 04:20.870
Kashima-kun.

04:21.560 --> 04:23.280
Kurose-san?

04:23.280 --> 04:26.870
I, um... If it's okay, would you mind 
helping me study?

04:27.180 --> 04:27.840
Huh?

04:27.840 --> 04:30.500
You're really good at English, right?

04:33.150 --> 04:39.550
I'm still not used to school yet, 
so it would be great if you could tutor me.

04:39.550 --> 04:43.980
It's just... I promised to help 
Shirakawa-san with English.

04:43.980 --> 04:47.260
Oh. Maybe after summer vacation starts?

04:47.830 --> 04:49.220
I don't...

04:49.220 --> 04:54.690
I'm also bad at math. Maybe I can ask you 
when I have questions about the homework.

04:54.690 --> 04:59.310
For math, you'd be better with Icchi. 
I mean Ijichi-kun. He's really good at it.

04:59.310 --> 05:00.650
Want me to introduce you?

05:01.380 --> 05:02.360
No.

05:03.090 --> 05:07.360
C-Can I at least get a LIME ID?

05:07.660 --> 05:08.950
Huh? Icchi's?

05:09.410 --> 05:11.910
No! I want yours!

05:12.440 --> 05:14.620
You know I'm not going to message you.

05:15.480 --> 05:16.960
O-Okay.

