Ryuto! Good morning!

05:47.360 --> 05:48.200
Good morning!

05:53.410 --> 06:00.130
<b>Ice</b>

06:01.720 --> 06:04.360
Beach!

06:10.240 --> 06:11.420
Who is this?

06:11.830 --> 06:13.820
Shirakawa-san?

06:13.820 --> 06:15.720
Correct!

06:16.530 --> 06:18.910
Ta-da! Well?

06:18.910 --> 06:21.150
<i>Oh... oh...</i>

06:21.670 --> 06:25.280
<i>Ah... Ahh!</i>

06:25.280 --> 06:29.600
<i>I can't believe I have such a bodacious
 goddess as a girlfriend!</i>

06:29.600 --> 06:33.120
<i>It's too much! I'm getting overstimulated!</i>

06:33.120 --> 06:35.420
What? Do I look weird?

06:35.420 --> 06:37.690
N-No! It's just...

06:37.690 --> 06:39.940
What? Spit it out!

06:42.920 --> 06:46.880
Oh, look at you! Are you having a fun 
beach date with your bikini babe?

06:46.880 --> 06:48.740
Shirakawa-san!

06:49.520 --> 06:51.830
Your face is bright red, Ryuto!

06:51.830 --> 06:53.220
Come on, let's go!

06:53.600 --> 06:56.460
Summer's gonna end if you don't hurry up!

07:00.630 --> 07:04.090
Hey, Ryuto. Will you rub sunscreen on me?

07:04.090 --> 07:05.900
<i>P-Pardon me?</i>

07:06.170 --> 07:08.620
I can't reach my back.

07:08.620 --> 07:09.860
Will you?

07:10.710 --> 07:12.570
S-Sure.

07:12.570 --> 07:15.240
Okay, here I rub.

07:15.240 --> 07:17.210
Yeah, go ahead.

07:22.000 --> 07:23.880
<i>Ah, she's so warm.</i>

07:24.340 --> 07:26.920
Oh. Would you also get under my swimsuit?

07:26.920 --> 07:28.670
You can move the straps if you need to.

07:28.670 --> 07:29.990
Wh-Whoof?

07:29.990 --> 07:31.880
S-Sure. I got it.

07:39.720 --> 07:40.700
What's wrong?

07:40.700 --> 07:43.820
The way you're touching me really tickles!

07:43.820 --> 07:45.230
Oh, sorry.

07:45.630 --> 07:47.830
<i>What do I do?</i>

07:48.880 --> 07:50.570
<i>Thirteen times one is thirteen.</i>

07:50.570 --> 07:52.110
<i>Thirteen times two is twenty-six.</i>

07:52.110 --> 07:54.240
<i>Thirteen times three is thirty-nine.</i>

07:55.840 --> 07:57.200
Thanks, Ryuto.

07:58.230 --> 08:02.410
On the contrary, thank you. Very much.

08:02.410 --> 08:04.370
For what?

08:04.750 --> 08:07.480
Huh? Oh, never mind.

08:10.850 --> 08:13.960
<i>All I did was put sunscreen on her, 
but it wore me out.</i>

08:13.960 --> 08:18.520
<i>I gotta respect the boyfriends of the world 
who can go on beach dates like it's nothing.</i>

08:18.520 --> 08:21.020
<i>How many times have you guys 
played through life already?</i>

08:21.430 --> 08:22.730
Ryuto!

08:24.480 --> 08:26.490
Let's get in the water!

08:26.490 --> 08:27.940
Come on, come on!

08:28.530 --> 08:29.800
I'm coming!

08:37.960 --> 08:38.890
Take that!

08:50.300 --> 08:52.000
Here ya go.

08:58.480 --> 09:01.450
I'm so glad the weather was nice today.

09:01.450 --> 09:05.730
Me too. Even though they said 
there was a typhoon coming.

09:06.080 --> 09:09.210
It must be a reward, since I've been 
on such good behavior!

09:09.210 --> 09:11.440
You should be grateful, Ryuto.

09:12.580 --> 09:13.780
Yeah, thanks.

09:15.000 --> 09:17.880
Shirakawa-san, you know...

09:17.880 --> 09:18.810
Hmm?

09:18.810 --> 09:21.370
That shwim—... That swimsuit

09:21.840 --> 09:23.860
looks really good on you.

09:26.870 --> 09:30.110
You're telling me that now? So unfair!

09:30.110 --> 09:31.940
Huh? Why?

09:31.940 --> 09:34.840
I wasn't ready for that at all.

09:35.150 --> 09:36.260
Geez.

09:38.040 --> 09:42.100
But thanks. I like this swimsuit too.

09:44.540 --> 09:49.230
I tried on about thirty different ones, 
and by the end Nicole was like...

09:49.230 --> 09:51.200
Why can't you make up your damn mind?

09:51.200 --> 09:53.150
And got pissed off at me.

09:53.520 --> 09:57.120
But then when I told Nicole that you 
and I were going to the beach,

09:57.120 --> 09:59.160
she came over and did my nails for me!

09:59.500 --> 10:00.990
Check it out!

10:01.370 --> 10:03.960
She did a pattern that goes with the swimsuit.

10:03.960 --> 10:07.130
Aren't they heavenly? They're mega cute!

10:07.130 --> 10:08.960
Yeah, they're great!

10:10.440 --> 10:11.450
Uh-oh.

