<b>Enoden</b>

10:14.130 --> 10:16.590
<b>Platform</b>

10:14.130 --> 10:16.590
<b>Number of Cars</b>

10:14.130 --> 10:16.590
<b>Destination</b>

10:14.130 --> 10:16.590
<b>Due to the typhoon, trains have...</b>

10:16.590 --> 10:18.550
<b>Enoshima Inn</b>

10:20.510 --> 10:23.080
M'kay. I'll call you later.

10:24.560 --> 10:26.770
Was your dad okay with it?

10:26.770 --> 10:30.600
Yeah. I told him he can relax 
because I'm with a friend.

10:30.600 --> 10:31.690
What about you?

10:32.210 --> 10:33.660
Yeah, it's okay.

10:35.400 --> 10:37.690
One night for two is 6,000 yen.

10:37.690 --> 10:38.860
Then we'll take that.

10:39.160 --> 10:41.140
Is one room all right?

10:41.590 --> 10:45.000
With two rooms, 
it would be 5,000 yen per person.

10:45.000 --> 10:46.500
Um...

10:46.930 --> 10:48.600
It's fine with me.

10:49.170 --> 10:50.900
O-Oh.

10:51.600 --> 10:54.120
Th-Then one room, please.

10:56.880 --> 10:59.970
Oh! The room is a lot nicer than I expected.

11:01.510 --> 11:05.260
Shirakawa-san, why don't you 
go ahead and take a bath?

11:05.260 --> 11:06.300
Aren't you cold?

11:06.300 --> 11:08.040
Huh? But then what about you?

11:08.040 --> 11:11.310
I'm okay for now, since I already changed.

11:12.320 --> 11:14.860
Well, if you insist.

11:18.410 --> 11:21.120
I'm definitely not okay!

11:21.120 --> 11:24.200
What is unfolding? What is happening here?

11:24.200 --> 11:27.660
I'm going to spend a night 
in the same room as Shirakawa-san?!

11:28.020 --> 11:29.740
It's fine with me.

11:30.750 --> 11:33.390
"It's fine" meaning... <i>what's</i> fine, exactly?

11:33.390 --> 11:36.110
Simply sleeping in the same room together?

11:36.110 --> 11:41.520
Or does "it" mean... Does it mean... 
the other stuff that goes along with that?

11:42.220 --> 11:44.820
I don't get it!

11:50.560 --> 11:52.230
I'm back.

11:54.450 --> 11:55.670
Ryuto?

11:58.520 --> 12:02.570
Oh, hey, Shirakawa-san. 
I was just doing some sit-ups.

12:02.920 --> 12:06.090
What a surprise! 
I didn't know you were into that.

12:06.090 --> 12:08.060
Let me feel your stomach.

12:09.220 --> 12:10.250
Huh? No!

12:11.010 --> 12:12.460
Oh. Sorry.

12:13.560 --> 12:17.210
Why don't you go in too? 
The stone bath is really nice.

12:17.210 --> 12:20.150
Uh, yeah. I guess I will.

12:28.760 --> 12:31.480
<i>What was that? What was it this time?</i>

12:31.480 --> 12:33.370
<i>What was that "sorry" for?</i>

12:33.800 --> 12:36.690
<i>Because I looked like 
I didn't want her to touch me?</i>

12:37.750 --> 12:42.440
<i>Or was it, "Sorry for leading you on 
when I don't actually want to do it today"?</i>

