Here, Ryuto.

12:59.390 --> 13:01.140
Th-Thanks.

13:02.450 --> 13:04.090
What, Ryuto?

13:04.090 --> 13:06.300
Hey, don't stare! I'm not wearing makeup.

13:06.670 --> 13:07.370
Huh?

13:07.920 --> 13:12.080
<i>Just now, she reminded me 
of Kurose-san a tiny bit.</i>

13:12.080 --> 13:15.310
<i>Oh, I never responded 
to that message this morning.</i>

13:16.070 --> 13:18.670
D-Do I look that bad without makeup?

13:18.670 --> 13:20.200
Stop staring!

13:20.200 --> 13:24.030
Uh, no. You don't look that different. But...

13:25.300 --> 13:26.490
But?

13:27.250 --> 13:30.200
You look a little younger. And cute.

13:30.870 --> 13:34.440
You're embarrassing me! Stop looking!

13:36.080 --> 13:38.140
I'll turn off the light.

13:38.140 --> 13:38.890
Okay.

13:46.020 --> 13:47.380
<i>I can't sleep!</i>

13:50.900 --> 13:52.590
Hey, Ryuto.

13:52.590 --> 13:53.890
Hmm?

13:54.550 --> 13:58.180
Are you good? Are you able to sleep like this?

13:59.730 --> 14:01.310
Wh-What?!

14:02.530 --> 14:03.780
Wanna do it?

14:13.080 --> 14:14.360
Wanna do it?

14:18.240 --> 14:20.480
Are you okay with that, Shirakawa-san?

14:20.480 --> 14:24.880
It seems like you 
don't really feel like it yet.

14:24.880 --> 14:28.840
No, but I don't wanna make you 
put up with waiting for so long.

14:29.960 --> 14:34.410
But I'd just be making <i>you</i> put up
 with something you don't want.

14:34.410 --> 14:39.450
Well, I wouldn't really be putting up with it... 
I mean, I like you, Ryuto,

14:39.450 --> 14:42.020
so it's not like I don't want to do it.

14:42.280 --> 14:43.790
<i>Y-Yes!</i>

14:43.790 --> 14:45.030
It's just...

14:48.210 --> 14:49.950
Until I started dating you,

14:49.950 --> 14:53.990
there weren't a lot of times I felt like 
getting intimate with my boyfriend.

14:54.520 --> 14:58.620
But when we were on the boat before, 
for the first time in my life,

14:58.620 --> 15:01.140
I really felt like I wanted to kiss.

15:02.930 --> 15:07.710
I must like you a lot more now 
than I did a month ago.

15:07.710 --> 15:09.670
Shirakawa-san...

15:10.630 --> 15:16.350
I'm going to like you more and more, 
and I'm going to want to feel you more.

15:16.720 --> 15:21.180
If we have sex when I honestly, 
truly want to go all the way with you,

15:21.180 --> 15:22.730
for the first time in my life,

15:22.730 --> 15:26.440
I think it will make my body 
and my heart both feel really good.

15:26.440 --> 15:28.300
I've been looking forward to that.

15:32.640 --> 15:36.200
All right. So for tonight, 
we should just sleep.

15:36.480 --> 15:39.160
Huh? Is that really okay?

15:39.730 --> 15:43.900
It's okay. We can wait 
until you truly feel ready.

15:45.040 --> 15:48.590
Ryuto, why are you so nice to me?

15:49.540 --> 15:50.950
Well, that's...

15:52.290 --> 15:55.300
because I like you, Shirakawa-san.

16:00.240 --> 16:03.810
Hey, Ryuto. Can I make one selfish request?

16:04.710 --> 16:05.710
Sure, go ahead.

16:05.710 --> 16:08.570
Will you hold me?

16:09.440 --> 16:10.330
Huh?

16:11.970 --> 16:13.050
No?

16:14.160 --> 16:15.540
Y-Yes.

16:16.820 --> 16:17.780
Here.

16:25.570 --> 16:27.680
<i>This is the first time we've hugged!</i>

16:27.680 --> 16:29.630
<i>Shirakawa-san smells so good.</i>

16:29.930 --> 16:34.060
Ryuto, you're warm. This is so relaxing.

16:35.830 --> 16:36.810
Yeah.

16:39.360 --> 16:44.020
We're gonna spend our two-month 
anniversary together like this too, right?

16:44.020 --> 16:47.820
I just hope we don't get stranded 
by another typhoon.

16:49.730 --> 16:51.230
Me too.

17:07.920 --> 17:09.880
<b>Ryuto</b>

17:07.920 --> 17:09.880
<b>Are you free on the
 23rd? It'd be cool if you
 could tutor me then</b>

17:07.920 --> 17:09.880
<b>summer school on that day</b>

17:09.880 --> 17:12.920
Why can't it be me? Why?

17:13.360 --> 17:15.590
How can I be like Runa?

17:22.510 --> 17:26.190
Bye! Let's have a great second month, Ryuto.

17:26.460 --> 17:28.180
Yeah, let's.

17:36.630 --> 17:39.490
<i>I didn't sleep a wink last night after all.</i>

17:47.170 --> 17:49.040
<i>I gotta get home to sleep.</i>

17:49.040 --> 17:51.840
Hmm? It's Kashima Ryuto.

17:51.840 --> 17:54.050
<b>Closed</b>

17:52.420 --> 17:54.050
Yamana-san?

17:56.500 --> 17:58.010
You're comin' in.

18:00.760 --> 18:03.160
Eat. It's the staff meal.

18:05.990 --> 18:07.640
I said eat!

18:07.930 --> 18:09.350
Thank you for the food!

18:10.690 --> 18:12.820
So how're things with Runa?

18:13.480 --> 18:16.780
I'm pleased to say we're getting along.

18:17.190 --> 18:20.150
You know, Runa is clingier than she looks.

18:20.800 --> 18:23.320
Doesn't she message you every night?

18:23.320 --> 18:24.240
Uh, yeah.

18:24.800 --> 18:26.700
And you're cool with that?

18:26.700 --> 18:31.170
Yeah. It makes me happy to know 
she's thinking about me.

18:32.440 --> 18:37.450
Well, that's what dating is all about. 
But Runa's exes were all scum,

18:37.450 --> 18:40.760
calling her a "burden" and "annoying" 
and always playing the victim.

18:41.120 --> 18:44.220
They'd say "She's so clingy" 
like she was a curse or something,

18:44.220 --> 18:47.370
but when you entrust someone 
with your emotional baggage

18:47.370 --> 18:50.670
and when they entrust you with theirs,

18:50.670 --> 18:54.920
if the scales balance out, 
then neither side feels like it's too heavy.

18:54.920 --> 18:57.790
That's how a balanced relationship works.

18:57.790 --> 19:01.230
It's a two-way road 'cause it's a two-way load.

18:58.440 --> 19:02.450
<b>Two-Way
 Load</b>

18:59.740 --> 19:02.450
<b>Two-Way 
Road</b>

19:01.230 --> 19:02.450
You hear me?

19:02.450 --> 19:04.090
Uh, yeah.

19:04.090 --> 19:06.060
That's quite a clever way of putting it.

19:06.730 --> 19:09.100
I can be poetic sometimes.

19:09.830 --> 19:14.090
So listen. Runa has been jinxed 
by the Two-Month Barrier.

19:14.090 --> 19:16.800
The Two-Month Barrier?

19:16.800 --> 19:21.130
A bunch of her exes cheated on her 
before two months were up

19:21.480 --> 19:25.690
or went cold on her after two months 
and eventually dumped her.

19:25.690 --> 19:27.640
Oh. I see.

19:27.640 --> 19:32.590
Even if Runa trusts you, 
I bet she's still worried right now.

19:35.050 --> 19:40.400
Can you promise me you'll never do 
anything to make her worry about that?

19:40.900 --> 19:45.740
Yeah! I promise. I won't do anything 
to make her worry about us.

19:47.700 --> 19:48.780
Okay.

19:49.680 --> 19:51.100
That's a relief.

19:56.710 --> 20:00.890
We're gonna spend our two-month 
anniversary together like this too, right?

20:01.660 --> 20:06.820
<i>So Shirakawa-san was worried about us. 
I won't make her carry that load.</i>

20:11.000 --> 20:12.100
Maria

20:11.000 --> 20:12.100
<b>Audio</b>

20:14.390 --> 20:16.060
Yes. Hello?

20:16.060 --> 20:19.780
<i>Oh, hi. Ryuto? It's me, Runa! Runa!</i>

20:20.060 --> 20:22.610
Shirakawa-san? But why...?

20:22.610 --> 20:26.300
<i>Did I surprise you? 
I'm at my mom's house right now,</i>

20:26.300 --> 20:28.490
<i>and I saw Maria 
and we started talking about stuff.</i>

20:28.490 --> 20:29.280
Huh?

20:29.280 --> 20:33.080
<i>My battery died,
so I'm borrowing Maria's phone.</i>

20:33.550 --> 20:35.640
Oh... okay.

20:36.090 --> 20:40.090
<i>You know, Ryuto, I want to talk to you.</i>

20:40.090 --> 20:42.670
<i>Just the two of us, at school right now.</i>

20:42.670 --> 20:47.880
At school, now? Sorry, I can't today. 
I'm just too tired.

20:47.880 --> 20:49.890
<i>Please! You've got to!</i>

20:55.590 --> 20:56.820
All right.

21:01.360 --> 21:02.840
Let's play games at my place.

21:02.840 --> 21:04.600
Yeah! I'll bring chips and pop.

21:05.070 --> 21:06.780
<b>Maria</b>

21:05.070 --> 21:06.780
<b>Voice Call</b>

21:05.070 --> 21:06.780
<b>I'm here, Shirakawa-san</b>

21:05.070 --> 21:06.780
<b>Come to the storage room in the gym</b>

21:10.530 --> 21:11.700
Shirakawa-san?

21:15.090 --> 21:17.380
Ryuto. Come over here.

21:21.990 --> 21:25.220
Hey, Ryuto. I want to do it with you.

21:25.220 --> 21:26.340
Huh?

21:29.450 --> 21:33.100
<i>Can her feelings change 
that much in just one day?</i>

21:33.450 --> 21:35.980
<i>But still, in a place like this?</i>

21:44.800 --> 21:47.040
<i>Serious? That's awesome.</i>

21:47.720 --> 21:51.960
Yeah! Ryuto really is my "last man."

23:26.320 --> 23:27.770
On the next <i>Our Dating Story</i>,

23:27.770 --> 23:32.470
the experienced you cheats 
with an experienced someone else?

23:33.890 --> 23:38.020
Kashima Ryuto, you broke your promise to me!

23:38.020 --> 23:40.020
<b>Our Cheating Story: The Experienced You Cheats with an Experienced Someone Else?</b>
